From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:48:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(motion): keep circular ramp transitions at depth

Use the certified keep-down link between eligible Circular ramp levels.
Start the ramp within 0.1 mm above remaining material.
Keep smaller entry gaps and explicit alternative link choices.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #1807
